@vindex agent-todo-in-progress-keyword
The @samp{agent-todo} module has one option@comma{} formerly named after Claude. @code{agent-todo-in-progress-keyword} is the Org TODO keyword @code{agent-send-todo-at-point} moves a heading to once it has been sent@comma{} and it replaces @code{agent-claude-org-todo-in-progress-keyword}@comma{} which remains as an obsolete alias. The keyword defaults to @code{nil}@comma{} which leaves the TODO state alone@comma{} because Org ships with only TODO and DONE and has no intermediate state to move to; set it to whichever in-progress keyword your own @code{org-todo-keywords} declares.

